 "steps": [
  {
   "caption": "The 1s are the minterms with an odd number of 1 bits: 1, 2, 4, 7, 8, 11, 13, 14. They form a checkerboard.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "n1",
     "set": {
      "text": "odd number of 1 bits → 1"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Every neighbour of a 1 is a 0: moving to a neighbour flips one bit, which changes the parity. Here m1 = 0001 and its neighbours m0, m3, m5, m9 all have an even number of 1s.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "kg",
     "set": {
      "highlight": [
       [
        0,
        1
       ],
       [
        0,
        0
       ],
       [
        0,
        2
       ],
       [
        1,
        1
       ],
       [
        3,
        1
       ]
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n2",
     "set": {
      "text": "each neighbour flips one bit → parity flips"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "So no two 1s are adjacent: every prime implicant is a single minterm, and the minimal SOP has all 8 minterms (32 literals). The compact form is the XOR A ⊕ B ⊕ C ⊕ D.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "kg",
     "set": {
      "highlight": []
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n3",
     "set": {
      "text": "8 PIs, each one cell"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "ex",
     "set": {
      "text": "f = A ⊕ B ⊕ C ⊕ D",
      "tone": "success"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "A partial checkerboard, where only some variables alternate, does group: 1s where B = D form the two quads B′D′ (corners) and BD (centre), so f = B′D′ + BD = (B ⊕ D)′.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "kg",
     "set": {
      "values": [
       [
        "1",
        "",
        "",
        "1"
       ],
       [
        "",
        "1",
        "1",
        ""
       ],
       [
        "",
        "1",
        "1",
        ""
       ],
       [
        "1",
        "",
        "",
        "1"
       ]
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n1",
     "set": {
      "text": "1 where B = D"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n2",
     "set": {
      "text": "corners B′D′ + centre BD"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n3",
     "set": {
      "text": "A and C are free"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "ex",
     "set": {
      "text": "f = B′D′ + BD",
      "tone": "success"
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
